======================================================================

  Labeled objects:    1024
  Iso classes:        12
  Score classes:      9
  Objective values:   7
  Label fraction:     64.2%
  OCR (score->H):     96.99%
  Compression:        1024x -> 12x -> 9x -> 7x -> 1

